WEBVTT

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:39.870 line:0%
[Episode 34]

00:01:51.309 --> 00:01:52.160 line:0%
Watch closely.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:52.800 line:0%
Like this.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.080 line:0%
Pinch it.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.220 line:0%
Why can't I pinch it?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.330 line:0%
This way.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.330 line:0%
♫Embracing each other, how serious we are about love♫

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:51.100 line:0%
♫Bit by bit, all of it is sealed away♫

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:55.220 line:0%
♫From every morning to every evening♫

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.410 line:0%
♫You and I will never be apart♫

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:02.420 line:0%
♫Unaware, you barged into my heart♫

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:06.140 line:0%
♫Slowly falling, lost in love without hesitation♫

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:10.020 line:0%
♫I charge into battle, unwavering and strong♫

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:10.970 line:0%
Shen Du, it's snowing.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.450 line:0%
♫Because you are my responsibility♫

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:17.390 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.280 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:21.160 line:0%
Come on.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.100 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.770 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:29.910 line:0%
Look.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:32.820 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:03:33.629 --> 00:03:36.670 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.840 line:0%
This snow

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.490 line:0%
has finally fallen.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:40.620 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.420 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:47.640 line:0%
♫You're my only true love♫

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.610 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.360 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:03.420 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.330 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:07.010 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:11.160 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.920 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:18.800 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:04:19.699 --> 00:04:22.680 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:26.030 line:0%
♫You're my only true love♫

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.850 line:0%
What I said to Prime Minister Zhang today,

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.640 line:0%
was it too much?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.400 line:0%
You can't spend your whole life

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.040 line:0%
being insincere

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.840 line:0%
and acting as a fake spy for Prime Minister Zhang.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:55.570 line:0%
This matter will have to be resolved eventually.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.160 line:0%
But today,

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.240 line:0%
you suddenly mentioned the old Shen family case to Prime Minister Zhang.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:00.960 line:0%
Do you have

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.220 line:0%
any new speculations?

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.800 line:0%
I deliberately

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.010 line:0%
intended to test his reaction.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:08.760 line:0%
Now it seems

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.700 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang definitely knows something.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.680 line:0%
These days,

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.560 line:0%
all the clues are in disarray.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.440 line:0%
We can't be completely certain yet,

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.860 line:0%
but what we can be sure of is

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.440 line:0%
long before the incident at the Shen's Mansion,

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:25.680 line:0%
there was more than one force

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:28.160 line:0%
that had started plotting behind the scenes.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.360 line:0%
I have a hunch.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:30.360 line:0%
What is it?

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.200 line:0%
I'm thinking

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.440 line:0%
the situation your father was in back then

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:38.200 line:0%
isn't too different from yours now.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:40.840 line:0%
I mean,

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.240 line:0%
mediating between several factions,

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:44.800 line:0%
trying to maintain dignity

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.459 line:0%
and neutrality is difficult.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.150 line:0%
One small misstep might...

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.780 line:0%
Everyone will turn against you when you're down.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.080 line:0%
But it's not wrong to stay true to yourself.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.880 line:0%
Not bowing down to the powerful

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.010 line:0%
isn't wrong either.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.600 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.940 line:0%
please continue to do what you should do

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.340 line:0%
and what you want to do.

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:07.200 line:0%
I will do my best

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.040 line:0%
to help you uncover the truth

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:11.100 line:0%
and clear the Shen family's name.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.250 line:0%
Snow falls on the winter solstice.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.620 line:0%
Next year will be a good one.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.360 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, you are nothing special after all.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.160 line:0%
I'd like to see

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.620 line:0%
if you can catch up with me.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.730 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:05.420 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.440 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:12.430 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:16.220 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:18.730 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:22.610 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:26.050 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.810 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:33.800 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.700 line:0%
♫I want to be with you forever♫

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:40.590 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.120 line:0%
♫In this life♫

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.440 line:0%
♫I'll only cherish you in my heart♫

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.040 line:0%
Nerd Jiang. Nerd Jiang.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:24.240 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:24.960 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.000 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.080 line:0%
How are you? Are you cold?

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.160 line:0%
Of course I'm cold.

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.880 line:0%
Are you feeling any better?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.040 line:0%
Where did you just go?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.410 line:0%
I went to buy you some food.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.360 line:0%
Try it.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:05.630 line:0%
It's delicious.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:06.680 line:0%
Slow down.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:10.180 line:0%
Your cheeks are all puffed up from eating.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.150 line:0%
It's delicious.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.720 line:0%
Let's build a snowman.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:46.810 line:0%
Does it look like you?

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.400 line:0%
How does that look like me?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.720 line:0%
This one I made looks more like you.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:51.520 line:0%
It doesn't.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.200 line:0%
Yours doesn't look like me at all.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:53.960 line:0%
Mine looks like you.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.160 line:0%
You made yours so fat.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:57.820 line:0%
Slow down.

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:00.640 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.720 line:0%
Chase me!

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.570 line:0%
It's snowing, use an umbrella.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:49.380 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.080 line:0%
Huan.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:52.530 line:0%
You've always loved winter snow.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:55.550 line:0%
You said

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.880 line:0%
white snow is the purest,

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.360 line:0%
able to cover all

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.760 line:0%
the filth and ugliness in the world.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:07.970 line:0%
Huan,

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.890 line:0%
how have I been doing

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.130 line:0%
all these years?

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.080 line:0%
Are you satisfied?

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.560 line:0%
I really don't know

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:25.600 line:0%
if I've done anything wrong.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.040 line:0%
Tell me,

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.640 line:0%
when we meet

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.750 line:0%
in the underworld,

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.650 line:0%
will you blame me?

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.370 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.240 line:0%
Just now,

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.280 line:0%
the incense smoke got in my eyes.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.120 line:0%
Why have you come back?

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.720 line:0%
Didn't I tell you

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.910 line:0%
to take time off for the holiday?

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.320 line:0%
I'm usually

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.880 line:0%
accustomed to handling state affairs.

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:11.760 line:0%
Now that I have free time,

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.200 line:0%
I find it rather dull.

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:16.080 line:0%
Besides, I feel that on a snowy night like this,

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.800 line:0%
it's especially boring and lonely.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.200 line:0%
That's why I asked Musician Jin

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.560 line:0%
to come here with me.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:23.400 line:0%
I thought we could have some fun with you, Your Majesty.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:24.280 line:0%
Oh, you,

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.680 line:0%
I understand.

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.960 line:0%
You must think that I

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:29.880 line:0%
am all alone,

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.360 line:0%
sad by myself

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.160 line:0%
and deliberately found some nice words to say.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:35.920 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.960 line:0%
I have just composed a new piece

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.720 line:0%
called "Joy and Sorrow".

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.880 line:0%
I wonder if you

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.080 line:0%
would be interested in listening to it.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.540 line:0%
Prepare more food.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.320 line:0%
Today,

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:50.240 line:0%
we shall be like common folk

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.400 line:0%
and have a lively,

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:53.440 line:0%
festive time eating and drinking

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.760 line:0%
to celebrate the Winter Solstice.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.140 line:0%
[As A Gentle Breeze]

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:16.480 line:0%
Don't melt, don't melt, don't melt.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.400 line:0%
Don't melt.

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.050 line:0%
You can't.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:29.550 line:0%
You can't.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.910 line:0%
You can only be mine.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:35.160 line:0%
Mine.

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.560 line:0%
What I, Lai Luozhi, want,

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.420 line:0%
[As A Gentle Breeze]

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.010 line:0%
I will not allow anyone to take it away.

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:56.120 line:0%
I won't allow it.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.030 line:0%
[As A Gentle Breeze]

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:09.500 line:0%
Alright.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.160 line:0%
Here.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.440 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.170 line:0%
Lord Lai requests an audience.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.120 line:0%
Let him in.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.000 line:0%
On such a snowy night,

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.760 line:0%
what is he doing here?

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.000 line:0%
Mr. Lai.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.600 line:0%
Why aren't you at home enjoying the holiday?

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:47.000 line:0%
What brings you here on such a snowy night?

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.000 line:0%
Is there something urgent?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.320 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.720 line:0%
I have just received an anonymous report.

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:53.720 line:0%
It claims that Yan Xing

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:55.120 line:0%
was deliberately arranged by Prime Minister Zhang

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.480 line:0%
to be placed by Grand Commander Shen's side,

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.080 line:0%
with the intention of winning over Grand Commander Shen.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.240 line:0%
On the day of the Winter Solstice,

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.520 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang even used the safety of the Yan family

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.520 line:0%
to coerce Yan Xing into compliance.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.320 line:0%
It seems someone

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.740 line:0%
is trying to stir up trouble out of nothing.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.790 line:0%
Could it be that this Yan Xing

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.910 line:0%
is truly Prince Xian's person?

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.080 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:18.280 line:0%
I'm afraid

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:20.320 line:0%
there might be some misunderstanding here.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:21.590 line:0%
The report also states

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.000 line:0%
that when Your Majesty

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.080 line:0%
issued the imperial decree for marriage,

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.880 line:0%
it was clearly meant for the third daughter of the Yan family,

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.200 line:0%
but the Yan family deliberately

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.440 line:0%
switched it to the sixth daughter.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.680 line:0%
Now, this Yan Xing

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.960 line:0%
has risen to the position of Director in the Ministry of Justice.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.350 line:0%
It's clear that the Yan family's marriage arrangement

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.600 line:0%
is treacherous.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.810 line:0%
Could it be that this Yan Xing

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.730 line:0%
is truly Prince Xian's person?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.590 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.620 line:0%
I dare to speak.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.410 line:0%
Yan Xing

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.880 line:0%
is my niece.

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.590 line:0%
I know that

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.520 line:0%
from a young age, she has always wanted to become

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.470 line:0%
a female investigator loyal to the court.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.920 line:0%
Although by some twist of fate,

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:55.840 line:0%
she married into the Shen family,

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.880 line:0%
her heart remains pure

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.840 line:0%
without a trace of malicious intent.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.840 line:0%
I beg Your Majesty to consider this.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.110 line:0%
Jin Zang,

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.060 line:0%
you have been allowed to play music

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.480 line:0%
in my chambers for many years,

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:13.110 line:0%
and this is the first time you've dared to discuss state affairs.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.720 line:0%
Your humble servant is terrified.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.790 line:0%
Mr. Lai,

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.670 line:0%
is this matter of Yan Xing

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:23.160 line:0%
worth you rushing here in the middle of the night?

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:25.730 line:0%
Do you have any other urgent matters

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.330 line:0%
to report while you're here?

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:29.200 line:0%
I have just learned

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:30.920 line:0%
that within Xiang'an City,

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.920 line:0%
a nursery rhyme has suddenly started circulating.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.400 line:0%
Upon hearing it, I felt it was highly inappropriate.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.520 line:0%
A nursery rhyme?

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.080 line:0%
Red porridge and dates,

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.710 line:0%
five feet from heaven.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:41.630 line:0%
Tangerines and loquats,

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.030 line:0%
hard for a child to grasp.

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:44.170 line:0%
Don't speak idly,

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:45.550 line:0%
who dares to allow?

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:46.770 line:0%
The old lady scolds,

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:47.880 line:0%
salt prices rise.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.680 line:0%
Madam Xu, with your keen intellect,

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.600 line:0%
you must have already discerned

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.760 line:0%
where the issue lies.

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.120 line:0%
This nursery rhyme directly points to Her Majesty.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.200 line:0%
"Five feet from heaven."

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.360 line:0%
"Hard for a child to grasp."

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.640 line:0%
This is clearly a great disrespect

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.720 line:0%
to both the Grand Empress Dowager and His Majesty!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:00.790 line:0%
How dare they!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.200 line:0%
This nursery rhyme

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.680 line:0%
cannot be baseless rumors.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.440 line:0%
There must be some villains

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.869 line:0%
plotting and directing behind the scenes.

00:17:05.869 --> 00:17:07.669 line:0%
We await Your Majesty's decree.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.860 line:0%
Can you investigate

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:19.860 line:0%
who is spreading such rumors?

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.360 line:0%
It's being passed from child to child in the streets and alleys,

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.619 line:0%
making it difficult to trace the source.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.750 line:0%
All these years...

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.870 line:0%
All these years, I

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:42.990 line:0%
have devoted myself wholeheartedly to the Xiao family's reign,

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.570 line:0%
yet there are always those who believe that I

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.400 line:0%
am acting out of self-interest.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.920 line:0%
Using a nursery rhyme like this

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.690 line:0%
to mislead people

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.140 line:0%
is truly despicable.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.600 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department will immediately launch a full investigation

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.640 line:0%
and will certainly, on behalf of Your Majesty,

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.040 line:0%
root out those with malicious intentions.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.000 line:0%
However...

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.700 line:0%
What is it?

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.680 line:0%
However, the melody used in this nursery rhyme

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:08.980 line:0%
is actually the new tune composed by Musician Jin

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.800 line:0%
at the Prince Xian's Mansion

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.120 line:0%
during the Winter Solstice banquet for the officials,

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.280 line:0%
specifically composed for the occasion.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.940 line:0%
It's called "Joy and Sorrow."

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.410 line:0%
I beg Your Majesty to understand,

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:24.930 line:0%
this tune was composed by me

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:27.330 line:0%
inspired by the Winter Solstice festival.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.480 line:0%
It was indeed first performed

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:31.300 line:0%
at the banquet in the Prince Xian's Mansion,

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.330 line:0%
but the melody had no lyrics,

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.630 line:0%
and there was certainly no intention of disloyalty.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:37.610 line:0%
Then what if

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.320 line:0%
the player had no intention,

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.520 line:0%
but the listener did?

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.520 line:0%
The last line of that nursery rhyme,

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:43.680 line:0%
"The old lady scolds,

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:44.840 line:0%
salt prices rise."

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.520 line:0%
The salt implies saltiness,

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.760 line:0%
which I'm afraid refers to Prince Xian.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:54.910 line:0%
Summon Prince Xian.

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:01.360 line:0%
Mother,

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.060 line:0%
I know nothing of this.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.160 line:0%
I have been wronged.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.080 line:0%
I also heard the song "Joy and Sorrow"

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.960 line:0%
for the first time

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:07.840 line:0%
on the day of the banquet.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:08.960 line:0%
I paid no further attention to it

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.840 line:0%
and had no idea

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.800 line:0%
that someone would take this opportunity

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.600 line:0%
to add lyrics alluding to you, Mother.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:14.640 line:0%
I believe

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:16.200 line:0%
this was certainly not done by Musician Jin,

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.060 line:0%
nor was it ordered by Prince Xian.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:19.920 line:0%
However, this tune by Musician Jin

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.000 line:0%
was just performed for the first time at the Prince Xian's Mansion,

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.280 line:0%
and immediately had subversive lyrics added to it,

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:25.160 line:0%
spreading through the streets and alleys.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.000 line:0%
Moreover,

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.320 line:0%
the end of this nursery rhyme

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.680 line:0%
directly implies that Prince Xian is seeking promotion.

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.740 line:0%
I beg Mother to see clearly;

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.920 line:0%
someone must be using this nursery rhyme

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:39.840 line:0%
to drive a wedge between us, mother and son,

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:40.760 line:0%
and our affection for each other.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:42.560 line:0%
They even want to take my life.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:43.320 line:0%
Mother!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:44.880 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.760 line:0%
these treasonous words are deceiving the country.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:47.800 line:0%
If we don't make a decision on this matter,

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.080 line:0%
and it continues to spread,

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.080 line:0%
at best, it will affect the reputation

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.600 line:0%
of Prince Xian and Musician Jin.

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.120 line:0%
At worst, it could be interpreted by those with ill intentions

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.120 line:0%
as proof that Prince Xian truly has

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.640 line:0%
treasonous thoughts.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.670 line:0%
I request that Your Majesty immediately order

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:04.840 line:0%
me to arrest all those

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.660 line:0%
who attended the banquet at Prince Xian's Mansion

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.390 line:0%
for a thorough investigation.

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:14.640 line:0%
This matter

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:19.590 line:0%
arose from Prince Xian's banquet,

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:21.400 line:0%
causing this trouble.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.470 line:0%
Starting from today,

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.480 line:0%
Prince Xian, Xiao Zhong,

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.120 line:0%
is confined to his mansion.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.160 line:0%
Jin Zang, who composed the tune,

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:36.210 line:0%
will be detained at the Imperial Investigation Department pending investigation.

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:39.420 line:0%
As for the other musicians who attended the banquet,

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.480 line:0%
order the Imperial Investigation Department

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.130 line:0%
to conduct a thorough investigation.

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:50.140 line:0%
As you command, Your Majesty.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.270 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.520 line:0%
Grand Commander, Madam.

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.310 line:0%
[Hold Fast to the Golden Mean]

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:08.460 line:0%
Madam Xu has sent someone with a secret message.

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:18.250 line:0%
What has happened?

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.000 line:0%
The wind changed direction last night.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:25.240 line:0%
You must be extremely careful.

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:26.400 line:0%
Don't let the current Shen and Yan families

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:29.600 line:0%
follow in the footsteps of the Shen family from years ago.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:30.720 line:0%
Help! Save me!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:32.080 line:0%
-Let’s go.
-Help me!

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.240 line:0%
Save me, Master!

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:35.020 line:0%
Master, save me! Master!

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.240 line:0%
Hurry!

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.360 line:0%
Help me find Xing!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:38.600 line:0%
Find the Grand Commander!

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:39.680 line:0%
Help me find Xing

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:41.040 line:0%
and the Grand Commander!

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.400 line:0%
-Hurry up.
-Hurry up.

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:46.610 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.120 line:0%
You really need to help me find them!

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:47.280 line:0%
Find them to save me!

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.760 line:0%
Quick! Go inform Sixth Lady!

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:51.440 line:0%
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.640 line:0%
Close the door quickly! Close the door!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:57.540 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:54.770 line:0%
Quick! Close the door, close the door!

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:04.120 line:0%
Go in.

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:17.080 line:0%
Zang.

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:20.880 line:0%
What's going on?

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:22.160 line:0%
Sister.

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:24.450 line:0%
Zang.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:28.540 line:0%
What happened?

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:29.810 line:0%
Let's go.

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:30.750 line:0%
Zang.

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:31.680 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:32.200 line:0%
No.

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:33.920 line:0%
Behave yourself.

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:34.780 line:0%
-No.
-Let's go.

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.800 line:0%
-Zang.
-Go!

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:51.360 line:0%
Father.

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:52.600 line:0%
What's happening?

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:53.900 line:0%
How could Mother be taken away?

00:22:53.900 --> 00:22:54.560 line:0%
Xing.

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:55.920 line:0%
Your mother was taken by

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:57.010 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:22:57.010 --> 00:22:58.120 line:0%
They say your uncle Jin Zang

00:22:58.120 --> 00:22:59.740 line:0%
was involved in Prince Xian's rebellion.

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:01.660 line:0%
The whole clan will be implicated.

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:03.190 line:0%
My uncle is just a musician.

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:04.520 line:0%
How could he be involved in a rebellion?

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:05.300 line:0%
It's impossible.

00:23:05.300 --> 00:23:06.600 line:0%
This is a false accusation.

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:07.240 line:0%
Xing,

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:08.280 line:0%
don't panic.

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:10.130 line:0%
Although Ms. Jin has been taken away,

00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:11.150 line:0%
for now,

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:13.240 line:0%
the Yan family hasn't been implicated yet.

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:14.360 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:15.360 line:0%
probably won't

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.360 line:0%
give you trouble for the time being.

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:19.560 line:0%
The Yan family hasn't been implicated.

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:21.610 line:0%
That's right, Father.

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:22.960 line:0%
Although Mother's surname is Jin,

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.260 line:0%
she has married into the Yan family.

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:25.160 line:0%
She's an out-married daughter.

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:25.980 line:0%
Logically speaking,

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:27.620 line:0%
even if the whole clan is implicated, it shouldn't affect her.

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:28.720 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department has no reason

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:29.850 line:0%
to take Mother away.

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:37.450 line:0%
Those people from the Imperial Investigation Department

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:39.520 line:0%
are just like the underworld's ghost officers.

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:41.100 line:0%
There's no reasoning with them.

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:42.250 line:0%
Whoever they want to arrest,

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:43.910 line:0%
they just arrest, don't they?

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:46.680 line:0%
No, that's not right.

00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:49.700 line:0%
It's not that they're unreasonable,

00:23:49.700 --> 00:23:50.560 line:0%
it's that you

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:52.690 line:0%
don't dare to reason with them, right?

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:54.910 line:0%
Father, Mother,

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:56.320 line:0%
you let the Imperial Investigation Department

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:57.240 line:0%
indiscriminately

00:23:57.240 --> 00:23:58.240 line:0%
arrest my mother.

00:23:58.240 --> 00:23:59.480 line:0%
You didn't even dare to stand up

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:00.360 line:0%
to ask a question or try to stop them,

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:01.160 line:0%
did you?

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:09.680 line:0%
Okay.

00:24:10.480 --> 00:24:12.200 line:0%
You're all afraid of Black Rakshasa.

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:13.060 line:0%
I'm not afraid.

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:14.820 line:0%
If you're too scared to save her, I'll go save her.

00:24:14.820 --> 00:24:16.340 line:0%
Xing!

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:18.720 line:0%
Xing.

00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:27.300 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:24:30.280 --> 00:24:31.080 line:0%
Xing!

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:31.840 line:0%
Chuichui?

00:24:33.040 --> 00:24:34.720 line:0%
I've finally found you.

00:24:34.880 --> 00:24:35.920 line:0%
The Grand Commander

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:36.400 line:0%
had Jing Lin pass on

00:24:36.400 --> 00:24:37.880 line:0%
a message from the palace,

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:39.560 line:0%
He said he would meet with Her Majesty

00:24:39.560 --> 00:24:41.090 line:0%
to plead for the Jin family.

00:24:42.200 --> 00:24:43.920 line:0%
Nerd Jiang and I split up to look for you.

00:24:43.920 --> 00:24:44.680 line:0%
I guessed

00:24:44.680 --> 00:24:46.680 line:0%
you'd returned to the Yan's Mansion.

00:24:46.680 --> 00:24:47.480 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:24:47.850 --> 00:24:48.650 line:0%
Thank you.

00:24:49.560 --> 00:24:51.530 line:0%
But this matter implicates His Highness Prince Xian.

00:24:51.530 --> 00:24:52.550 line:0%
The future is uncertain.

00:24:52.550 --> 00:24:54.300 line:0%
Shen Du's help alone may not be enough.

00:24:54.300 --> 00:24:55.280 line:0%
You go back first.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:57.080 line:0%
I'll go to Prime Minister Zhang.

00:24:57.560 --> 00:24:58.280 line:0%
Alright.

00:24:58.280 --> 00:24:59.690 line:0%
Take care of yourself.

00:25:23.740 --> 00:25:25.080 line:0%
Is that you, Nerd Jiang?

00:25:31.610 --> 00:25:32.450 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:25:41.040 --> 00:25:42.230 line:0%
Seeing it's me,

00:25:43.120 --> 00:25:44.450 line:0%
you seem disappointed.

00:25:45.480 --> 00:25:46.280 line:0%
I...

00:25:46.480 --> 00:25:48.180 line:0%
I have an appointment with Jiang Langxing.

00:25:48.180 --> 00:25:49.930 line:0%
He'll be here to meet me soon.

00:25:50.520 --> 00:25:51.680 line:0%
Jiang Langxing.

00:25:52.210 --> 00:25:53.470 line:0%
Jiang Langxing.

00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:56.240 line:0%
Is he all you can see

00:25:56.860 --> 00:25:58.310 line:0%
in your eyes now?

00:26:06.780 --> 00:26:08.300 line:0%
Being so obedient,

00:26:08.670 --> 00:26:09.650 line:0%
how nice.

00:26:18.990 --> 00:26:20.740 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:26:24.090 --> 00:26:26.090 line:0%
I am Yan Xing, Director in the Ministry of Justice,

00:26:26.090 --> 00:26:28.950 line:0%
requesting an audience with Prime Minister Zhang.

00:26:29.880 --> 00:26:30.680 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:26:30.700 --> 00:26:32.530 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang is not in the mansion today.

00:26:32.530 --> 00:26:33.730 line:0%
I've made inquiries.

00:26:33.960 --> 00:26:35.270 line:0%
Since the incident with Prince Xian,

00:26:35.270 --> 00:26:36.810 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang has been refusing all visitors.

00:26:36.810 --> 00:26:38.740 line:0%
He didn't even attend court today.

00:26:40.920 --> 00:26:42.540 line:0%
Director in the Ministry of Justice,

00:26:42.170 --> 00:26:46.350 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:26:42.600 --> 00:26:44.160 line:0%
wife of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:26:44.160 --> 00:26:46.880 line:0%
Yan Xing, the sixth daughter of Dr. Yan's family,

00:26:46.880 --> 00:26:49.540 line:0%
request an audience with Prime Minister Zhang.

00:26:49.960 --> 00:26:50.760 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:52.310 line:0%
please don't make things difficult for me.

00:26:52.310 --> 00:26:53.820 line:0%
I won't trouble you.

00:26:54.040 --> 00:26:55.880 line:0%
I'll just wait outside the Prime Minister's residence.

00:26:55.880 --> 00:26:57.120 line:0%
I can stand here for a day or two.

00:26:57.120 --> 00:26:59.300 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang will have to come out eventually, won't he?

00:26:59.300 --> 00:27:00.560 line:0%
Surely he wouldn't...

00:27:01.000 --> 00:27:03.040 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang, just to avoid me, a mere woman,

00:27:03.040 --> 00:27:04.480 line:0%
go out the back door,

00:27:04.500 --> 00:27:06.180 line:0%
or even crawl through a dog hole, would he?

00:27:05.830 --> 00:27:07.440 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:27:14.490 --> 00:27:15.440 line:0%
I knew it.

00:27:15.440 --> 00:27:16.640 line:0%
You, Yan Xing,

00:27:16.640 --> 00:27:18.240 line:0%
are not easy to dismiss.

00:27:18.480 --> 00:27:20.000 line:0%
If I hadn't come out,

00:27:20.400 --> 00:27:22.200 line:0%
you would have dared to

00:27:22.240 --> 00:27:25.440 line:0%
turn this minister's mansion upside down, wouldn't you?

00:27:26.590 --> 00:27:29.520 line:0%
I beg you, Prime Minister Zhang, to save the Jin clan.

00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:39.070 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:27:34.720 --> 00:27:36.380 line:0%
You don't need to pressure me.

00:27:36.600 --> 00:27:38.060 line:0%
As for what you're asking,

00:27:38.200 --> 00:27:39.760 line:0%
I can't help you.

00:27:41.010 --> 00:27:42.240 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang,

00:27:42.240 --> 00:27:43.640 line:0%
you are the current Prime Minister,

00:27:43.640 --> 00:27:44.880 line:0%
the head of state.

00:27:44.880 --> 00:27:46.360 line:0%
The Jin clan is clearly wronged.

00:27:46.360 --> 00:27:47.620 line:0%
You can't ignore this.

00:27:47.840 --> 00:27:48.600 line:0%
Since you have

00:27:48.600 --> 00:27:50.820 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's palace token,

00:27:50.820 --> 00:27:51.600 line:0%
why do you need to

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:53.400 line:0%
come all this way to seek my help?

00:27:54.040 --> 00:27:56.170 line:0%
In front of the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:27:56.760 --> 00:27:57.440 line:0%
I am just

00:27:57.440 --> 00:27:59.390 line:0%
a minor official who can only engage in idle talk.

00:27:59.390 --> 00:28:00.690 line:0%
If I mistakenly thought

00:28:00.690 --> 00:28:02.760 line:0%
I could interfere with state affairs in her presence,

00:28:02.760 --> 00:28:05.220 line:0%
that would be overestimating my abilities.

00:28:05.940 --> 00:28:08.270 line:0%
Since you can understand this principle,

00:28:08.300 --> 00:28:13.910 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:28:08.760 --> 00:28:09.960 line:0%
why don't you understand

00:28:09.960 --> 00:28:11.720 line:0%
why Lai Luozhi this time

00:28:11.720 --> 00:28:14.400 line:0%
used Musician Jin as a scapegoat?

00:28:17.440 --> 00:28:18.360 line:0%
Because of me?

00:28:19.310 --> 00:28:21.090 line:0%
The reason for this matter

00:28:21.390 --> 00:28:23.710 line:0%
is partly because you are Shen Du's wife,

00:28:24.240 --> 00:28:25.320 line:0%
and partly because you are that

00:28:25.320 --> 00:28:26.480 line:0%
troublemaker,

00:28:26.480 --> 00:28:28.640 line:0%
Yan Xing, the official from the Ministry of Justice.

00:28:28.640 --> 00:28:29.440 line:0%
Of course,

00:28:29.920 --> 00:28:31.400 line:0%
it's not just that.

00:28:32.080 --> 00:28:32.880 line:0%
It is said that

00:28:33.160 --> 00:28:34.560 line:0%
on the night of the winter solstice,

00:28:34.560 --> 00:28:35.360 line:0%
this Lai Luozhi

00:28:35.360 --> 00:28:37.480 line:0%
reported to the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:28:37.480 --> 00:28:40.040 line:0%
claiming that I sent you to the Shen's Mansion

00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:41.880 line:0%
to win over Shen Du

00:28:42.360 --> 00:28:44.760 line:0%
and form a clique for personal gain.

00:28:45.320 --> 00:28:46.120 line:0%
Musician Jin

00:28:46.120 --> 00:28:47.640 line:0%
argued in court,

00:28:47.640 --> 00:28:50.520 line:0%
even daring to defy the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:28:54.480 --> 00:28:55.600 line:0%
Uncle, he...

00:28:57.440 --> 00:28:58.200 line:0%
He

00:28:58.200 --> 00:28:59.920 line:0%
argued with the Grand Empress Dowager for my sake?

00:28:59.920 --> 00:29:01.780 line:0%
According to our dynasty's laws,

00:29:01.800 --> 00:29:03.530 line:0%
palace servants and musicians

00:29:03.840 --> 00:29:05.960 line:0%
are forbidden from discussing state affairs.

00:29:05.960 --> 00:29:07.890 line:0%
Violators face the death penalty.

00:29:08.080 --> 00:29:09.650 line:0%
This Jin Zang,

00:29:09.960 --> 00:29:11.370 line:0%
relying on his favor,

00:29:11.560 --> 00:29:13.320 line:0%
was far too presumptuous.

00:29:14.530 --> 00:29:17.190 line:0%
My uncle is not being arrogant because of favor,

00:29:17.720 --> 00:29:19.650 line:0%
nor is he overestimating himself.

00:29:20.250 --> 00:29:22.050 line:0%
It's because he is my uncle.

00:29:22.250 --> 00:29:24.390 line:0%
He sees me as his own flesh and blood.

00:29:24.730 --> 00:29:26.270 line:0%
Even at the risk of a capital offense,

00:29:26.270 --> 00:29:27.950 line:0%
he doesn't want to see me suffer.

00:29:27.660 --> 00:29:35.410 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:29:29.200 --> 00:29:30.150 line:0%
Xing,

00:29:30.840 --> 00:29:32.240 line:0%
for all these years,

00:29:32.680 --> 00:29:33.960 line:0%
I have been

00:29:34.080 --> 00:29:36.280 line:0%
exploiting your Yan family more than caring for it.

00:29:36.280 --> 00:29:37.340 line:0%
But in this matter,

00:29:37.600 --> 00:29:39.960 line:0%
I have said all I can.

00:29:40.800 --> 00:29:41.640 line:0%
Between protecting Prince Xian

00:29:41.640 --> 00:29:43.370 line:0%
and protecting the Jin family,

00:29:44.040 --> 00:29:47.080 line:0%
I have no choice.

00:30:01.690 --> 00:30:04.390 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:30:08.240 --> 00:30:09.370 line:0%
Back then,

00:30:10.250 --> 00:30:12.110 line:0%
in the old case of the Shen family,

00:30:12.360 --> 00:30:14.000 line:0%
were you faced with

00:30:14.020 --> 00:30:15.580 line:0%
the same choice?

00:30:20.250 --> 00:30:26.220 line:0%
[Zhang's Mansion]

00:30:26.900 --> 00:30:27.900 line:0%
Your Excellency.

00:30:36.480 --> 00:30:38.320 line:0%
Prince Xian has been confined this time.

00:30:38.320 --> 00:30:40.320 line:0%
Yet I have remained silent.

00:30:41.120 --> 00:30:42.360 line:0%
Do you know why?

00:30:42.890 --> 00:30:44.050 line:0%
I do not know, sir.

00:30:46.240 --> 00:30:48.880 line:0%
I watched the Prince Xian grow up.

00:30:49.460 --> 00:30:51.710 line:0%
My feelings towards the Prince Xian

00:30:52.160 --> 00:30:53.400 line:0%
are just like Jin Zang's

00:30:53.400 --> 00:30:54.840 line:0%
towards Yan Xing.

00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:57.940 line:0%
How could I not want to

00:30:58.060 --> 00:31:00.320 line:0%
risk these old bones for the Prince Xian?

00:31:01.620 --> 00:31:03.640 line:0%
This disaster caused by the nursery rhyme,

00:31:03.640 --> 00:31:05.440 line:0%
I am very clear

00:31:05.840 --> 00:31:06.800 line:0%
that the Prince Xian has no

00:31:06.800 --> 00:31:08.860 line:0%
intention of usurping or rebelling.

00:31:09.040 --> 00:31:12.370 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager surely understands this as well.

00:31:14.560 --> 00:31:15.920 line:0%
However, the Grand Empress Dowager

00:31:15.920 --> 00:31:17.960 line:0%
is not just a mother,

00:31:20.680 --> 00:31:22.320 line:0%
she is also our Cang State's

00:31:22.320 --> 00:31:23.920 line:0%
Grand Empress Dowager.

00:31:24.480 --> 00:31:25.920 line:0%
If I were to intervene,

00:31:26.280 --> 00:31:27.760 line:0%
my disciples behind me

00:31:27.760 --> 00:31:29.360 line:0%
would follow suit one by one,

00:31:29.560 --> 00:31:32.240 line:0%
petitioning the Grand Empress Dowager

00:31:32.240 --> 00:31:34.760 line:0%
to force her to release Prince Xian.

00:31:38.510 --> 00:31:40.860 line:0%
The more we pressure her like this,

00:31:41.630 --> 00:31:45.750 line:0%
the more we push Prince Xian towards a dead end.

00:31:46.430 --> 00:31:48.890 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:31:49.960 --> 00:31:50.760 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:31:51.440 --> 00:31:52.240 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:31:53.200 --> 00:31:54.120 line:0%
What's wrong? Why are you in such a hurry?

00:31:54.120 --> 00:31:55.450 line:0%
Has Chuichui returned?

00:31:55.480 --> 00:31:56.520 line:0%
Didn't she

00:31:56.520 --> 00:31:57.880 line:0%
go out together with you?

00:31:57.880 --> 00:31:59.400 line:0%
We split up to look for Yan Xing.

00:31:59.400 --> 00:32:00.800 line:0%
Hasn't she come back yet?

00:32:01.810 --> 00:32:03.080 line:0%
Then it's possible that

00:32:03.080 --> 00:32:04.800 line:0%
after finding Director Yan,

00:32:04.800 --> 00:32:06.360 line:0%
she went off somewhere to have fun.

00:32:06.360 --> 00:32:07.120 line:0%
Here's what you should do.

00:32:07.120 --> 00:32:07.880 line:0%
Go ask Director Yan.

00:32:07.880 --> 00:32:08.880 line:0%
Then you'll know.

00:32:08.880 --> 00:32:09.400 line:0%
Alright.

00:32:09.400 --> 00:32:10.120 line:0%
Go and ask.

00:32:10.120 --> 00:32:11.880 line:0%
What's this about finding Director Yan?

00:32:11.880 --> 00:32:13.080 line:0%
How can he go to Director Yan?

00:32:13.080 --> 00:32:14.400 line:0%
What's the matter, My Lord?

00:32:14.400 --> 00:32:15.440 line:0%
Director Yan?

00:32:16.160 --> 00:32:17.400 line:0%
Something big has happened to Director Yan's family.

00:32:17.400 --> 00:32:18.260 line:0%
You don't know?

00:32:20.680 --> 00:32:21.840 line:0%
The Jin family

00:32:22.040 --> 00:32:23.920 line:0%
is suspected of inciting Prince Xian to rebel.

00:32:23.920 --> 00:32:26.560 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department has rounded them all up.

00:32:26.560 --> 00:32:27.360 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:32:28.040 --> 00:32:29.640 line:0%
No matter how big the issue is recently,

00:32:29.640 --> 00:32:30.760 line:0%
don't bother Director Yan.

00:32:30.760 --> 00:32:31.800 line:0%
Director Wu is right.

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:33.080 line:0%
I'll go look for her myself then.

00:32:33.080 --> 00:32:34.140 line:0%
I'll take my leave.

00:32:34.680 --> 00:32:35.880 line:0%
Slow down, slow down.

00:33:16.220 --> 00:33:17.340 line:0%
What is this place?

00:33:21.270 --> 00:33:23.400 line:0%
Everyone calls me the Black Rakshasa.

00:33:25.040 --> 00:33:26.080 line:0%
So this place

00:33:27.310 --> 00:33:29.030 line:0%
might be the underworld.

00:33:29.800 --> 00:33:31.130 line:0%
What are you going to do?

00:33:31.920 --> 00:33:33.250 line:0%
Are you going to kill me?

00:33:41.160 --> 00:33:42.690 line:0%
The eighteen levels of hell

00:33:43.930 --> 00:33:45.690 line:0%
are prepared for others.

00:33:47.200 --> 00:33:48.180 line:0%
As for you,

00:33:48.500 --> 00:33:49.280 line:0%
even if one day

00:33:49.280 --> 00:33:50.880 line:0%
you really arrive in the underworld,

00:33:50.880 --> 00:33:52.600 line:0%
I will use stark white bones as lamps,

00:33:52.600 --> 00:33:53.920 line:0%
and evil spirits as offerings,

00:33:53.920 --> 00:33:56.180 line:0%
to transform this hall of the King of Hell

00:33:56.760 --> 00:33:57.720 line:0%
into

00:33:58.660 --> 00:34:00.320 line:0%
a gentle paradise for you.

00:34:03.360 --> 00:34:04.920 line:0%
You can't escape.

00:34:22.410 --> 00:34:24.170 line:0%
Why are you afraid?

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:36.019 line:0%
I

00:34:36.950 --> 00:34:38.640 line:0%
won't hurt you.

00:34:45.680 --> 00:34:46.470 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:34:49.560 --> 00:34:50.950 line:0%
lift your head.

00:34:52.990 --> 00:34:53.800 line:0%
Look.

00:34:54.160 --> 00:34:54.950 line:0%
How is it?

00:34:55.640 --> 00:34:56.510 line:0%
Do you like it?

00:35:07.740 --> 00:35:09.670 line:0%
This... this...

00:35:14.700 --> 00:35:15.720 line:0%
I heard that you were very pleased with

00:35:15.720 --> 00:35:16.960 line:0%
the betrothal gifts Jiang Langxing

00:35:16.960 --> 00:35:18.160 line:0%
sent to your family.

00:35:22.680 --> 00:35:24.640 line:0%
So you like these things.

00:35:25.920 --> 00:35:27.600 line:0%
I've bought everything

00:35:27.840 --> 00:35:30.100 line:0%
that girls like from the Xiang'an market

00:35:30.480 --> 00:35:31.920 line:0%
and all the betrothal gifts

00:35:31.920 --> 00:35:33.680 line:0%
that wealthy families use

00:35:34.040 --> 00:35:35.500 line:0%
when proposing marriage.

00:35:35.630 --> 00:35:36.940 line:0%
What do you think?

00:35:39.000 --> 00:35:40.530 line:0%
What exactly are you doing?

00:35:41.030 --> 00:35:42.600 line:0%
Propose marriage, of course.

00:35:42.600 --> 00:35:43.660 line:0%
Propose marriage?

00:35:44.120 --> 00:35:45.790 line:0%
I'm asking for your hand in marriage,

00:35:45.790 --> 00:35:47.720 line:0%
asking you to be my wife, Lai Luozhi's wife.

00:35:47.720 --> 00:35:49.250 line:0%
What are you talking about?

00:35:49.550 --> 00:35:51.750 line:0%
I'm already engaged to Jiang Langxing.

00:35:51.760 --> 00:35:53.170 line:0%
I'm going to marry him.

00:35:54.860 --> 00:35:56.640 line:0%
That stuffy constable?

00:35:56.640 --> 00:35:58.040 line:0%
What's so good about him?

00:35:58.800 --> 00:35:59.800 line:0%
Whatever he has,

00:35:59.800 --> 00:36:01.440 line:0%
I can give you ten times as much.

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:03.570 line:0%
It has nothing to do with these things.

00:36:03.760 --> 00:36:05.620 line:0%
I've already agreed to marry him.

00:36:12.400 --> 00:36:14.400 line:0%
So what if you've agreed?

00:36:14.770 --> 00:36:18.570 line:0%
Even if you've had the wedding ceremony, you can still get divorced.

00:36:25.120 --> 00:36:26.850 line:0%
If you feel guilty towards him,

00:36:27.440 --> 00:36:29.440 line:0%
I can compensate him on your behalf.

00:36:30.320 --> 00:36:31.650 line:0%
As long as he's willing,

00:36:32.560 --> 00:36:34.400 line:0%
I can kill Xu Xiangren

00:36:35.120 --> 00:36:36.760 line:0%
and let him become the Constable Marshal.

00:36:36.760 --> 00:36:38.490 line:0%
Don't you dare act recklessly.

00:36:41.800 --> 00:36:42.860 line:0%
Alright,

00:36:43.930 --> 00:36:45.210 line:0%
I'll do as you say.

00:36:46.680 --> 00:36:48.360 line:0%
Why don't you understand?

00:36:50.290 --> 00:36:51.760 line:0%
Jiang Langxing and I,

00:36:51.840 --> 00:36:53.360 line:0%
we like each other.

00:36:53.400 --> 00:36:55.000 line:0%
We like each other too.

00:36:55.000 --> 00:36:56.440 line:0%
I like you very much.

00:36:56.640 --> 00:36:57.520 line:0%
I've never felt this way

00:36:57.520 --> 00:36:58.760 line:0%
about a woman before.

00:36:59.160 --> 00:37:00.480 line:0%
But I don't like you.

00:37:00.480 --> 00:37:01.400 line:0%
You're lying.

00:37:01.440 --> 00:37:02.770 line:0%
You clearly like me too.

00:37:04.800 --> 00:37:06.460 line:0%
Didn't you call me Ghost Face?

00:37:06.560 --> 00:37:08.280 line:0%
Don't you consider me a good friend?

00:37:08.280 --> 00:37:09.080 line:0%
And...

00:37:09.360 --> 00:37:10.200 line:0%
And our mothers

00:37:10.200 --> 00:37:11.440 line:0%
are buried in the same place.

00:37:11.440 --> 00:37:13.240 line:0%
This is destined fate.

00:37:13.240 --> 00:37:14.720 line:0%
The affection between friends

00:37:14.720 --> 00:37:15.680 line:0%
and the love for a romantic partner

00:37:15.680 --> 00:37:17.000 line:0%
are different.

00:37:17.280 --> 00:37:18.960 line:0%
I have no feelings for you.

00:37:19.500 --> 00:37:20.560 line:0%
Impossible.

00:37:20.640 --> 00:37:21.680 line:0%
You'll soon realize

00:37:21.680 --> 00:37:23.410 line:0%
that everything I said is true.

00:37:40.120 --> 00:37:41.160 line:0%
Let go of me.

00:38:56.660 --> 00:38:57.890 line:0%
It's alright.

00:38:59.410 --> 00:39:00.880 line:0%
I can wait patiently.

00:39:02.280 --> 00:39:03.280 line:0%
One day,

00:39:04.430 --> 00:39:06.030 line:0%
you will fall in love with me.

00:39:23.270 --> 00:39:30.260 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:39:29.840 --> 00:39:30.840 line:0%
Stop right there.

00:39:30.920 --> 00:39:31.960 line:0%
The Jin family treason case

00:39:31.960 --> 00:39:33.680 line:0%
is under the full jurisdiction of my Imperial Investigation Department.

00:39:33.680 --> 00:39:35.520 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice has no authority to interfere.

00:39:35.520 --> 00:39:36.320 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:39:36.360 --> 00:39:37.160 line:0%
please leave.

00:39:38.090 --> 00:39:43.060 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:39:38.800 --> 00:39:39.600 line:0%
Wait.

00:39:42.360 --> 00:39:43.160 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:39:43.560 --> 00:39:44.440 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:39:44.920 --> 00:39:45.920 line:0%
if you want to save your family,

00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:47.480 line:0%
it's actually quite simple.

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:49.170 line:0%
You just need to submit a petition

00:39:49.170 --> 00:39:50.810 line:0%
stating that the Jin family

00:39:50.830 --> 00:39:52.790 line:0%
was falsely accused by Shen Du.

00:39:52.820 --> 00:39:54.610 line:0%
I will help you overturn the case

00:39:54.610 --> 00:39:56.530 line:0%
and rescue your family.

00:39:58.480 --> 00:40:00.090 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:40:00.330 --> 00:40:02.720 line:0%
you're deliberately toying with me today.

00:40:02.720 --> 00:40:04.670 line:0%
You want me to falsely accuse my husband.

00:40:04.670 --> 00:40:06.470 line:0%
That's absolutely impossible.

00:40:07.020 --> 00:40:08.500 line:0%
I didn't realize

00:40:09.040 --> 00:40:10.400 line:0%
that you, who initially

00:40:10.400 --> 00:40:12.460 line:0%
married into the Shen family as a spy,

00:40:12.720 --> 00:40:14.040 line:0%
have now become

00:40:14.520 --> 00:40:16.760 line:0%
so deeply in love with Shen Du.

00:40:16.780 --> 00:40:17.660 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:40:18.520 --> 00:40:20.200 line:0%
you don't need to use the spy matter

00:40:20.200 --> 00:40:21.400 line:0%
as leverage anymore.

00:40:21.520 --> 00:40:22.320 line:0%
I have already

00:40:22.560 --> 00:40:23.520 line:0%
explained this matter

00:40:23.520 --> 00:40:25.220 line:0%
to my husband and Prime Minister Zhang.

00:40:25.220 --> 00:40:26.700 line:0%
I have a clear conscience.

00:40:27.160 --> 00:40:27.880 line:0%
I have not done anything

00:40:27.880 --> 00:40:29.520 line:0%
to wrong anyone.

00:40:29.710 --> 00:40:30.900 line:0%
In the Ministry of Justice,

00:40:30.900 --> 00:40:32.630 line:0%
I have been diligent in my duties,

00:40:32.630 --> 00:40:34.680 line:0%
always upholding the principle of uncovering the truth

00:40:34.680 --> 00:40:36.880 line:0%
and clearing the names of the wrongly accused.

00:40:36.880 --> 00:40:38.960 line:0%
Not to mention that Shen Du is my husband,

00:40:38.960 --> 00:40:40.600 line:0%
even if it were anyone else,

00:40:40.760 --> 00:40:41.840 line:0%
I, Yan Xing,

00:40:41.840 --> 00:40:43.280 line:0%
would absolutely never do anything

00:40:43.280 --> 00:40:43.840 line:0%
to disgrace my position

00:40:43.840 --> 00:40:46.170 line:0%
as an official of the Ministry of Justice.

00:40:46.840 --> 00:40:49.170 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, there's no need to be stubborn.

00:40:49.240 --> 00:40:50.440 line:0%
One day,

00:40:51.160 --> 00:40:52.160 line:0%
you will.

00:40:53.490 --> 00:41:02.500 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:40:54.890 --> 00:40:55.730 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:40:56.160 --> 00:40:56.960 line:0%
please leave.

00:41:02.220 --> 00:41:02.860 line:0%
Please.

00:41:36.400 --> 00:41:37.200 line:0%
Xing.

00:41:44.480 --> 00:41:45.280 line:0%
You're back.

00:41:46.640 --> 00:41:47.440 line:0%
Xing.

00:41:50.520 --> 00:41:52.980 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager hasn't relented.

00:41:53.360 --> 00:41:54.960 line:0%
I'll try to find another way.

00:41:56.520 --> 00:41:57.600 line:0%
I figured as much.

00:41:58.280 --> 00:42:00.360 line:0%
I went to see Prime Minister Zhang today.

00:42:00.360 --> 00:42:01.680 line:0%
I understand a bit more now

00:42:01.680 --> 00:42:04.140 line:0%
about the Grand Empress Dowager's dilemma.

00:42:05.160 --> 00:42:06.820 line:0%
Although I'm not in the court,

00:42:07.040 --> 00:42:09.250 line:0%
I can imagine the situation at the time.

00:42:09.440 --> 00:42:11.280 line:0%
If Lai Luozhi really fabricates charges

00:42:11.280 --> 00:42:12.400 line:0%
and pins false accusations

00:42:12.400 --> 00:42:13.880 line:0%
on Prince Xian,

00:42:15.110 --> 00:42:16.120 line:0%
it's no longer just about

00:42:16.120 --> 00:42:17.860 line:0%
the extermination of the Jin family.

00:42:17.860 --> 00:42:19.590 line:0%
It would lead to court turmoil,

00:42:19.840 --> 00:42:21.040 line:0%
succession battles,

00:42:26.680 --> 00:42:28.120 line:0%
and who knows how many families

00:42:28.120 --> 00:42:29.250 line:0%
would be destroyed.

00:42:30.120 --> 00:42:31.780 line:0%
I'll think of something else.

00:42:34.920 --> 00:42:35.720 line:0%
Tomorrow,

00:42:37.570 --> 00:42:39.160 line:0%
